# Project context

When working on Extract-Da-Panda, **read `PROJECT_MAP.md`** at the repo root first. Use it to:

- Understand the game architecture (game loop, rendering, map generation, player, enemies, UI).
- Find which files own which systems (e.g. `src/game/game-core.js` for the loop, `src/data/maps.js` for map generation).
- Avoid scanning the whole codebase when you need to change a specific system.

Then use that context for all edits, refactors, and answers about this codebase.
